          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Has KOS protein powder been recalled?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We found no recall notice for KOS protein powder as of November 16, 2026. Searches of the FDA recalls, market withdrawals and safety alerts database and the openFDA food enforcement records returned no KOS products. A Prop 65 warning on a label is a California disclosure, not a recall. Check the FDA database for the latest status."
