            KOS Organic Plant Protein does the things its label promises: 20 g of protein from five organic plant sources, no dairy, soy, sucralose or erythritol, a short natural sweetener list, and a testing program you can check batch by batch. No recall notice turned up in the FDA records we searched, and KOS is unusually open about heavy metals and Prop 65.
          </p>
